WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
One property enquiry. Every detail connected.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A webhook captures the request and routes the enquiry with its property reference.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The workflow creates an Asana task, linking viewing information and relevant property files.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Google Drive and Sheets supply documents and viewing links for the next step.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
New follow-up notes are merged into the existing task, keeping its history.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Less chasing. Clearer follow-ups.
